Jeremiah	Jer	28	29	30	And the word of the Lord came to Jeremias, saying:
Jeremiah	Jer	28	29	31	Send to all them of the captivity, saying: Thus saith the Lord to Semeias the Nehelamite: Because Semeias hath prophesied to you, and I sent him not: and hath caused you to trust in a lie:
