Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	1	The word that came to Jeremias from the Lord in the days of Joakim the son of Josias king of Juda, saying:
Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	2	Go to the house of the Rechabites: and speak to them, and bring them into the house of the Lord, into one of the chambers of the treasures, and thou shalt give them wine to drink.
