Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	4	And I brought them into the house of the Lord, to the treasure house of the sons of Hanan, the son of Jegedelias the man of God, which was by the treasure house of the princes, above the treasure of Maasias the son of Sellum, who was keeper of the entry.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	5	And I set before the sons of the house of the Rechabites pots full of wine, and cups: and I said to them: Drink ye wine.
