Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	8	Therefore we have obeyed the voice of Jonadab the son of Rechab, our father, in all things that he commanded us: so as to drink no wine all our days: neither we, nor our wives, nor our sons, nor our daughters:
Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	9	Nor to build houses to dwell in, nor to have vineyard, or field, or seed:
