Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	11	But when Nabuchodonosor king of Babylon came up to our land, we said: Come, let us go into Jerusalem from the face of the army of the Chaldeans, and from the face of the army of Syria: and we have remained in Jerusalem.
Jeremiah	Jer	28	35	12	And the word of the Lord came to Jeremias, saying:
