Ezechiel	Eze	31	9	9	And he said to me: The iniquity of the house of Israel, and of Juda, is exceeding great, and the land is filled with blood, and the city is filled with perverseness: for they have said: The Lord hath forsaken the earth, and the Lord seeth not.
Ezechiel	Eze	31	9	10	Therefore neither shall my eye spare, nor will I have pity: I will requite their way upon their head.
