Ezechiel	Eze	31	41	10	And between the chambers was the breadth of twenty cubits round about the house on every side.
Ezechiel	Eze	31	41	11	And the door of the side chambers was turned towards the place of prayer: one door was toward the north, and another door was toward the south: and the breadth of the place for prayer, was five cubits round about.
