1 Machabees	1Mac	45	2	39	And Mathathias and his friends heard of it, and they mourned for them exceedingly.
1 Machabees	1Mac	45	2	40	And every man said to his neighbour: If we shall all do as our brethren have done, and not fight against the heathens for our lives, and our justifications: they will now quickly root us out of the earth.
1 Machabees	1Mac	45	2	41	And they determined in that day, saying: Whosoever shall come up against us to fight on the sabbath day, we will fight against him: and we will not all die, as our brethren that were slain in the secret places.
