1 Machabees	1Mac	45	9	30	Now therefore we have chosen thee this day to be our prince, and captain in his stead to fight our battles.
1 Machabees	1Mac	45	9	31	So Jonathan took upon him the government at that time, and rose up in the place of Judas his brother.
1 Machabees	1Mac	45	9	32	And Bacchides had knowledge of it, and sought to kill him.
