1 Machabees	1Mac	45	9	58	And all the wicked held a council, saying: Behold Jonathan, and they that are with him, dwell at ease, and without fear: now therefore let us bring Bacchides hither, and he shall take them all in one night.
1 Machabees	1Mac	45	9	59	So they went, and gave him counsel.
